- New DateToWord component (A4 design) with 5 pastel NotebookLM format tabs
- Client-side converter (lib/dateToWords/converter.ts) — pure functions, all 5
  formats: formal, legal, banking, casual, british
- 50-language popular list (lib/languages/popularLanguages.ts) for translate
  request capture and locale redirect
- Per-variant translation capture (50 languages, email + language)
- Non-English locale selection forwards to /feedback?tool=date-words&type=
  suggestion with locale pre-filled
- Shared components extracted for all tool pages:
  * RelatedToolsGrid (NotebookLM pastel cards, auto-variant rotation)
  * FeedbackButton (floating FAB + popover with 3 type chips)
  * ToolTopbar (solid white nav matching hero)
  * ToolDisclaimer (lavender soft card with '!' mark)
- Friendly names throughout (variable names describe intent)
- Re-export shim (DateToWords.tsx) keeps legacy import path working
- 26 converter tests pass (smoke-test.mjs) — all 5 formats verified
